{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04170","headline":"咏怀古意上裴侍郎 · 骆宾王","name":"咏怀古意上裴侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十二余罢，鬓是潘安仁。\n四十九仍入，年非朱买臣。\n纵横愁系越，坎壈倦游秦。\n出笼穷短翮，委辙涸枯鳞。\n穷经不沾用，弹铗欲谁申。\n天子未驱策，岁月几沈沦。\n轻生长慷慨，效死独殷勤。\n徒歌易水客，空老渭川人。\n一得视边塞，万里何苦辛。\n剑匣胡霜影，弓开汉月轮。\n金刀动秋色，铁骑想风尘。\n爲国坚诚款，捐躯忘贱贫。\n勒功思比宪，决略暗欺陈。\n若不犯霜雪，虚掷玉京春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04170.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04170","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}